  { title: 'n\u2080 forgives the early chaos', n: "Restore c and slide n\u2080 back toward the origin. f(n)'s early oscillations now stick out above the ceiling; sliding n\u2080 right makes them legal again — 'eventually' is doing real work in the definition.", s: { view: 'O (upper)', n0: 6, cU: 2, cL: 0.7 } },
